WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.644
1. Go to Emails and reminders and open the email to change.

2
00:00:02.644 --> 00:00:06.915
2. For a reminder, set the Days before and click Save days.

3
00:00:06.915 --> 00:00:11.262
3. Change the subject or wording. Click a placeholder such as {Reference} to add it.

4
00:00:11.262 --> 00:00:16.647
4. Check the preview, then click Save wording. Every change is kept in the history.
